{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c75ea6bcaf3afec42f23c8b3e63387b8d94dbbdc7cb29b9adb3e640cbedd48d2", "ja": "新ユニットと水族館のコラボが決定！　準備\nのため現地を訪れた一同は、水族館をめいっ\nぱい楽しむ。帰り道、響は沖縄の海や、イル\nカのイル代の話をする。やよいは段々と、海\nのイメージが掴めてきた様子。", "zh": "新组合与水族馆的合作确定！为了准备工作，大家前往当地，尽情享受着水族馆。回去的路上，响聊起冲绳的大海和海豚“伊尔代”的事情。弥生似乎也渐渐找到了大海的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6096c27d4447c6178ac61b48e1a1b0c7e571168ff194ec227919b118f9323130", "ja": "（やよい達の新しいユニットが水族館とコラボする\n事になり、今日はその打ち合わせにやってきた！）", "zh": "（弥生她们的新组合要和水族馆合作，今天来这里开会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1001_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9b0d3dceea305c7c84465b83f7b3ffbfca3c710decab53cc71f5b16bb3616872", "ja": "おおよそコラボの内容は決まったな。\n打ち合わせ、スムーズに進んでよかったよ。", "zh": "大致确定了合作的内容。\n商讨能顺利进行真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "a714729f0a5ae192f71a56088a6ce75a90b420072730d8bcb3b39c4b452e1bd5", "ja": "期間中は限定グッズの他に、私たちの\n館内アナウンスが流れるんですよね？", "zh": "活动期间除了限定周边，还会播放我们的馆内广播，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "c924fec81da979d45f8ee3b0bf0345209856d82538126fc9e9fd0b8776bf8a0d", "ja": "とっても楽しみです！　水族館に来た人たちが\nいっぱい楽しめるように、がんばります！", "zh": "我非常期待！为了让来到水族馆的大家都能尽情享受，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "5d8270ff1ffb52de6bf0ae5b0ceca424676f1e8ae8f91ab461d504b629aa8e71", "ja": "それじゃあ、打ち合わせも終わった事だし……\nみんな！　水族館で、思い切り遊ぶぞー！", "zh": "那既然商量也结束了……大家！去水族馆尽情玩个痛快吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a3e2ba522118f6760a83e9c26cba94a8a77ea11613f7a19d8f75f5e3db0639c9", "ja": "見学な。水族館を実際に巡って、\nその体験をきちんと仕事に活かすための……。", "zh": "是参观。实地游览水族馆，\n是为了把体验切实运用到工作上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "48ba30025c3192044c970162f8415ab99ffbc9fca09181a7628a448c1333af3a", "ja": "自分、ここに来るの楽しみだったんだー！\nシャチやイルカに、早く会いたいさー！", "zh": "我一直很期待来这里的——！\n好想早点见到虎鲸和海豚啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "3b3bec07dae538a2af75908b15473cdafa37b58a7df5370db024e6d283712ef1", "ja": "私も楽しみです！　春香さん、\n{$P$}、早く行きましょー！", "zh": "我也很期待！春香姐，{$P$}，我们快走吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "f85ff25fab85723bc4157dfd4ea5c852b3e71e2feb575578aab6a32d4dab0ec7", "ja": "うわぁ～！　写真で見るより、\nずっと大きな水族館だぞ、やよい！", "zh": "哇——！这座水族馆比照片上看起来大多了，弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "0c8d0d6b8b057016ab02348626c81599a123c110cfb97a3d0759f81f2fb10f4c", "ja": "はい！　水槽が、すっごく大きいですー！\nそれに、どこを見ても、お魚がいっぱいですね！", "zh": "是的！水槽特别大呢——！\n而且不管看哪里，到处都是好多鱼呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "b4a1bd498756c84656215927a23851cd6cdcc4456474756438ed83eb43036015", "ja": "ふふっ♪　ふたりとも、すっかり\nテンションが上がっちゃってるみたいですね！", "zh": "呵呵♪　看来你们两个已经彻底兴奋起来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "00d86c8570717d6e1ccf7e9bf048f2bfaf56d45054601bd1f03e58155731c3ae", "ja": "ま、打ち合わせはしっかり\n聞いてたみたいだから、問題はないけどな。", "zh": "不过，刚才对流程的时候她们似乎听得很认真，\n倒是没什么问题就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ff9086d43fbcc2d27c11a72fbd0140ddfd964c5c6367f8471e1c58bdc044a7c", "ja": "もちろん、ちゃんと聞いてたぞ！\nそれに仕事もだけど、やよいの宿題もあるでしょ？", "zh": "当然听得很认真啦！\n而且除了工作之外，不是还有弥生的作业嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "2c882af3eece68c428ed0be5fcfa8c97853ab91a4209b37b689feae531cd73f2", "ja": "沖縄には行けないけど、自分が、海のことを教えて\nあげる！　ここには、海の仲間がたくさんいるからね！", "zh": "虽然没法去冲绳，但我来教你大海的知识！这里有很多海洋伙伴呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "ab5fde157a9b96f569b564d55827e15be8d6e65f9a23588b19e2ce6056444718", "ja": "はい！\n響さん、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的！\n响小姐，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "e1b9ed2b949e15c9f85a6bc2dc286d7da4aaaaab2e528cf29d3a13d680f673a5", "ja": "まずは……あ、あの大きなエイ！　ひらひらして\nかわいいけど、シッポには毒があるんだぞ。", "zh": "首先……啊、那条好大的鳐鱼！虽然飘飘悠悠的样子很可爱，但它尾巴上可是有毒的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "59b703e1fe55d20f920c22808bd906fc391232145cce18249cc8f15064e87c11", "ja": "あとサメもいるね！　あのサイズは一緒に泳ぐのに\nちょうどいいんだぞ。懐かしいな～♪", "zh": "还有鲨鱼呢！那种大小正适合一起游泳。真让人怀念啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "52a2070f783c998260941a009515da3fc8f9e9dedbd17c221dba690bd90b7f13", "ja": "えっ！？　さ、サメと一緒に\n泳いだりするんですか……？", "zh": "诶！？要、要和鲨鱼一起游泳吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "24cc32df5bfab46dcf298cb7528341bc44a7aecd9adc295ca1b4a7bc9e635437", "ja": "お腹を空かせてないサメなら平気さー！\n危ないのもいるから、それは気をつけるけどね。", "zh": "没饿着肚子的鲨鱼就没问题啦——！\n不过也有危险的鲨鱼，所以还是得小心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "f2fb12bfba98d0c4ed7021a21507282b4460cd765d105fedf738ae66484350b2", "ja": "さすが沖縄の海だな～。\nこっちのとはスケールが違うって感じだね。", "zh": "不愧是冲绳的海啊～。\n感觉和这里的完全不是一个规模呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "e837f0b15b9a4c74a077b13fc3c4aa9b85fedd8f261e3cb11756716ca49dd5b0", "ja": "本物はもっとすごいぞ！　沖縄の海は最強だからね！\nあっははははは！", "zh": "真正的海更厉害哦！冲绳的海可是最强的！啊哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "997e54daf0e0af5da5633ddb196bf4ae5b59d6f6188e8acf180421f3c50c93fa", "ja": "さいきょう……！\n沖縄の海って、すごいんですね！", "zh": "最强……！\n冲绳的大海，真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5f5aa61cab1fd650a9cad6d7a9e2c3e7bb11c720e65097076af56aea528b4af7", "ja": "理解に繋がってるのかな……？\nまあ、せっかくだから他も見学してみようか。", "zh": "这能帮助理解吗……？\n算了，难得来一趟，要不要也去参观一下其他地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1ae6c3347c30028b3b60745f0b7f16adb565ff0e1fc2d29fcd9224933d6acc2c", "ja": "（ちょうどイルカショーが始まるところだったので、\nみんなでショーを見学する事にした）", "zh": "（正好赶上要开始海豚表演了，于是大家决定一起观看表演）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8432955322b4180ef57e366ada2f9db1f4d0a55ba65dadb079b5745572a97c55", "ja": "（そうして、楽しいひとときは\nあっという間に過ぎていき……）", "zh": "（就这样，快乐的时光转眼间便流逝了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1028_001har", "source_sha256": "4289a6c27e0e8931747d192e8d34925bbf7d5e0028a029e514564dc38e7db940", "ja": "イルカって、あんなに高く飛べたんだね！\n私、びっくりしちゃった！", "zh": "原来海豚能跳那么高啊！\n我都吓了一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "1d434162700e85ac0a7860831d35716081086942dcab984b0fe5c31b470561de", "ja": "トレーナーのお姉さんとイルカ、\n息ぴったりだったね！　すっごく仲良しだった！", "zh": "训练员姐姐和海豚配合得真默契啊！关系特别好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "5484f2c02363d5a1c2dfb5a394da3303c4d65246d97375fc48d36c03857379f0", "ja": "どうしたの、やよい？　さっきも、イルカより\nステージの上を気にしてたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "怎么了，弥生？刚才你好像也比起海豚，更在意舞台上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "5a45f927899d06cd441b02166f7168f1fb5283755e7b79743a6568d1727598ce", "ja": "えっと……イルカって、たくさん\n食べるんだなーって思って……。", "zh": "那个……我只是觉得，海豚还真能吃啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c35ef662203c372caaf1105460eeabaedb646a0da7f1d37c610bada2530bab96", "ja": "ああ、イルカにあげるイワシを見てたのか。\nバケツ一杯分か……確かにすごい量だな。", "zh": "啊，原来你是在看要喂给海豚的沙丁鱼啊。\n满满一桶吗……确实分量不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1034_005yay", "source_sha256": "c65bd3e9502e8c51503251123bb5b6d60f53d8afa61bb57a73f8952800fb0947", "ja": "あれだけイワシがあったら、\nうちは3日……ううん、1週間くらいは……！", "zh": "要是能有那么多沙丁鱼，\n我家吃上3天……不对，吃上1个星期都够了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "c32bed61a5fd9227c390631ad625e85dfa1746502afd4a2d92a24c21fe2285e1", "ja": "そういうところが気になっちゃうんだね。\nやよいらしいっていうか……。", "zh": "你就是会在意这种地方呢。\n该说真不愧是弥生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "4aa8a033b19a5ccd6263c1c5261c84204c8252bdb6c18621888a9c3467381b45", "ja": "イルカは、体がおっきいからね。\nたくさん食べるんだぞ！", "zh": "海豚的身体很大嘛。\n所以吃得很多哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "1eb76182c2220733d01e3ff96f01487889a405197737579e93df32a71ba4dab4", "ja": "自分も、近くの海に住みついてたイルカのイル代には、\nよくエサをあげに行ったりしてたんだ。", "zh": "我以前也经常去给住在附近海里的海豚伊尔代喂食。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "4ff2c4cbfe899c511e54bc1b16774f0b31df164dc34efc5fb210f1c285d96099", "ja": "（イルカのイル代……）", "zh": "（海豚伊尔代……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "eda582be85a1c94f99111e8ea9a965baf9c127e19b34943c2325f20482c15a35", "ja": "だから、自分にとって海は庭で、遊び場で、\n家族のいる場所って感じかな！", "zh": "所以，对我来说，大海就像庭院、游乐场，还有家人所在的地方吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1040_005yay", "source_sha256": "0cfc503f96e9e3e12c89c9c161a8b3f4dcfd0e1134793bdfbc4c7fcf3e8904d6", "ja": "あっ。なんとなく……今の響さんのお話を聞いて、\nわかったことがあります！", "zh": "啊。总觉得……听了刚才响小姐说的话，\n我明白了一件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1041_005yay", "source_sha256": "48e789d765c90e13e32f777e72f54083336a075a5dc4fd18b419e8233d7597fc", "ja": "響さんの海って、\nとってもあったかい海なんですね！", "zh": "响姐说的大海，\n真的是一片非常温暖的大海呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "cbd6d7686b84fed600ee6cba0072bb33c4e9bb0733f20348b3594d6b813be9f7", "ja": "うん！　沖縄の海は水温が高くて、すっごく\n泳ぎやすいんだ！　やよいも絶対気に入ると思うぞ！", "zh": "嗯！冲绳的海水温很高，特别适合游泳！我觉得弥生肯定会喜欢的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1043_005yay", "source_sha256": "dd08d0b889db79a960534188fe6c9e23e5fd24791fbc8cbbec6f8635e9591f03", "ja": "わあ～、ほんとですか？\n沖縄の海、行ってみたいですー！", "zh": "哇～真的吗？\n我好想去冲绳的海边看看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1044_001har", "source_sha256": "740efe013a5e1407ede4a817a5da280d681c469720767b09a345c6afd9ca033b", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}さん、今の\nやよいの言葉って、そういう意味でした……？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生，刚才\n弥生说的话，是那个意思吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "66a298dd17461fa7e03a5a62aa294799c65056ab1928df86de0ac098def947c7", "ja": "はは、そうだな。でも、響の言葉で\nやよいが何か掴んだなら、それでいいんじゃないか。", "zh": "哈哈，确实是这样。不过，如果弥生从响的话里领悟到了什么，那就没什么不好了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1046_001har", "source_sha256": "2878d0914738507b47ba8ce47e3e2b4d5cf50eaed638ed2db17603145b02fe2b", "ja": "たしかに、そうかもしれませんね。\nふふっ！", "zh": "确实，或许是这样呢。\n呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "65cb3a95ec96139bc3ff03583f16a4305223f7f47bb99c3590074419a09e2f4c", "ja": "（やよい的に、収穫はあったみたいだ。\nこの調子で、海のイメージが掴めるといいな！）", "zh": "（对弥生来说，看来还是有所收获的。希望她能保持这个状态，抓住大海的感觉！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
